{"about_the_game":"\ud83c\udf54 Diner Simulator: Demo Edition \u2014 Just a Taste of the Chaos to Come<br>Your diner dreams are about to be tested \u2014 welcome to the free demo of Diner Simulator! Fire up the grill, flip some pancakes, and get a glimpse of the kitchen mayhem that awaits in the full game.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724120/extras/gif2.gif?t=1749457361\" /><br>In this demo, you'll step into the greasy shoes of a solo diner owner. Cook meals, serve impatient guests, clean up messes, and try to keep everything running smoothly during the breakfast and lunch rushes.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724120/extras/gif3.gif?t=1749457361\" /><br>Think you can handle it all? Or will the orders stack up and your dreams go up in smoke?<br><br>\ud83d\udd25 What\u2019s in the Demo:<br>\ud83c\udf73 Solo Gameplay Preview \u2013 Get hands-on with the core mechanics of cooking, serving, and managing your diner.<br>\ud83e\udd5e A Limited Menu \u2013 Master a small but mighty selection of recipes designed to test your multitasking skills.<br>\ud83c\udfd7\ufe0f Upgrade &amp; mastery \u2013 Expand your diner, add new appliances, and build the ultimate neighborhood hotspot.<br>\ud83d\udce6 No Co-Op (Yet!) \u2013 This demo focuses on solo play \u2014 bring your friends in the full version for maximum madness.<br>\ud83d\udca5 A Teaser, Not the Full Meal \u2013 Progress is limited, but the flavor of what\u2019s coming is all here.","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3724120?t=1749457361","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3724120?t=1749457361","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724120/0398db172a9c646aaa2a117a68ee18995e51f10a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749457361","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724120/0398db172a9c646aaa2a117a68ee18995e51f10a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749457361","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"\ud83c\udf54 Diner Simulator: Demo Edition \u2014 Just a Taste of the Chaos to Come<br>Your diner dreams are about to be tested \u2014 welcome to the free demo of Diner Simulator! Fire up the grill, flip some pancakes, and get a glimpse of the kitchen mayhem that awaits in the full game.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724120/extras/gif2.gif?t=1749457361\" /><br>In this demo, you'll step into the greasy shoes of a solo diner owner. Cook meals, serve impatient guests, clean up messes, and try to keep everything running smoothly during the breakfast and lunch rushes.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724120/extras/gif3.gif?t=1749457361\" /><br>Think you can handle it all? Or will the orders stack up and your dreams go up in smoke?<br><br>\ud83d\udd25 What\u2019s in the Demo:<br>\ud83c\udf73 Solo Gameplay Preview \u2013 Get hands-on with the core mechanics of cooking, serving, and managing your diner.<br>\ud83e\udd5e A Limited Menu \u2013 Master a small but mighty selection of recipes designed to test your multitasking skills.<br>\ud83c\udfd7\ufe0f Upgrade &amp; mastery \u2013 Expand your diner, add new appliances, and build the ultimate neighborhood hotspot.<br>\ud83d\udce6 No Co-Op (Yet!) \u2013 This demo focuses on solo play \u2014 bring your friends in the full version for maximum madness.<br>\ud83d\udca5 A Teaser, Not the Full Meal \u2013 Progress is limited, but the flavor of what\u2019s coming is all here.","developers":["Octo Games studio"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3684720","name":"Diner Simulator \ud83c\udf54"},"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id